{"4792770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DrugStore Team: Pharmacy Simulator", "steam_appid": 4792770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/260eb8f07f2a1f217d4e0b493b5bd30b.avif?t=1786195458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras_big/260eb8f07f2a1f217d4e0b493b5bd30b.webp?t=1786195458 width=1560 height=683 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/43c31687fe428c0daa84c68e30efd3e2.avif?t=1786195458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras_big/43c31687fe428c0daa84c68e30efd3e2.webp?t=1786195458 width=1560 height=835 /></span>In a game where <i><strong>every role</strong></i> has an impact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">on the growth of your pharmacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Develop your character’s <i><strong>skills</strong></i> and become:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-an expert at making medicine in your own laboratory,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-the best adviser for your customers’ health problems,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-a specialist in logistics and pharmacy supplies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and much more,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">but the game also lets you go one step further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose between <i><strong>caring for your patients</strong></i> and <i><strong>chasing ruthless profit.</strong></i><br>Just remember - there are people in the city who will always stand on the side of the law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/994eaf0c3e453799107c06fadbb8fb4c.poster.avif?t=1786195458\" width=1170 height=1224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/994eaf0c3e453799107c06fadbb8fb4c.webm?t=1786195458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/994eaf0c3e453799107c06fadbb8fb4c.mp4?t=1786195458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/27d12671378dfdaf822ef230aac78b7a.poster.avif?t=1786195458\" width=1170 height=1116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/27d12671378dfdaf822ef230aac78b7a.webm?t=1786195458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/27d12671378dfdaf822ef230aac78b7a.mp4?t=1786195458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/ab96d27f2ca97be782349737e2457625.poster.avif?t=1786195458\" width=1170 height=1224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/ab96d27f2ca97be782349737e2457625.webm?t=1786195458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/ab96d27f2ca97be782349737e2457625.mp4?t=1786195458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/908732af4899409bd3998f5ec3c4b200.avif?t=1786195458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras_big/908732af4899409bd3998f5ec3c4b200.webp?t=1786195458 width=1560 height=455 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/2ab5999095916364ef4223ebf80bc18e.avif?t=1786195458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras_big/2ab5999095916364ef4223ebf80bc18e.webp?t=1786195458 width=1560 height=1177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own pharmacy solo or with friends in <i><strong>“DrugStore Team”: Pharmacy Simulator</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop the skill tree for each role available in the game, or become a specialist in your chosen field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your pharmacy from the ground up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Design your pharmacy your way - build walls, create rooms, and place furniture and decorations however you like,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Stock your shelves and arrange products freely on shelves - no more wasted space,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Set prices, sell products and help customers with their health problems,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Create your own medicines and maintain your equipment,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hire employees,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More details coming soon!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792770/extras/260eb8f07f2a1f217d4e0b493b5bd30b.avif?t=1786195458\" data-big-src=http